<title>TURKMENISTAN: Turkmen industry output falls 9.9 pct in Jan-Feb 9.</title>
<headline>Turkmen industry output falls 9.9 pct in Jan-Feb 9.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan's industrial output fell by 9.9 percent in January-February of this year, compared to the same period last year, a report from the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    TURKMEN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT     Jan-Feb '97	 Jan-Feb '96</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	    -9.9		 +12.9</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
